  {
    "key": "usage.cache_formula_footnote",
    "zh-CN": "命中率 = 缓存读取 ÷（未缓存输入 + 缓存读取 + 缓存写入），按输入 token 加权。",
    "en": "Cache hit rate = cache read ÷ (uncached input + cache read + cache write), weighted by input tokens.",
    "params": {},
    "notes": "缓存命中视图表底公式说明。",
    "platforms": ["web", "android"],
    "status": { "zh-CN": "source", "en": "draft" }
  },
  {
    "key": "usage.cache_write_footnote",
    "zh-CN": "注：「—」表示该 CLI 或模型未单独上报缓存写入量，对应输入已计入未缓存输入，不影响总输入与命中率计算。",
    "en": "Note: “—” means the CLI or model did not report cache write separately; those input tokens are included in uncached input and do not affect total input or hit rate.",
    "params": {},
    "notes": "当表格包含缺失缓存写入上报的序列时显示的脚注。",
    "platforms": ["web", "android", "ios"],
    "status": { "zh-CN": "source", "en": "draft" }
